ngs. All periods end June 30.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod" startAt="1"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="tx1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Share price: Nasdaq closing price on October 15, 2026 ($539.44), unadjusted (stockanalysis.com daily history; cross-checked with Investing.com).</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod" startAt="1"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="tx1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Market cap = share price × 7,427M common shares outstanding at June 30, 2026 as reported in the FY2026 balance sheet data.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod" startAt="1"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="tx1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Enterprise value = market cap + total debt (current portion $9,227M + long-term $31,067M) − cash &amp; equivalents ($20,935M) − short-term investments ($55,908M); leases excluded.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod" startAt="1"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="tx1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Free cash flow = cash from operations ($182,935M) − additions to property and equipment ($115,948M). Finance-lease additions not deducted.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod" startAt="1"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="tx1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Operating margin = operating income ÷ revenue. Growth rates and CAGRs computed from reported revenue and operating income. Chart values in $ billions, rounded to one decimal.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod" startAt="1"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="tx1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Data compiled October 15, 2026; financial figures reflect the fiscal year ended June 30, 2026; share price, market cap and multiples use the October 15, 2026 close.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="25" name="Slide Number Placeholder 0"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldNum" sz="quarter" idx="4294967295"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="8229600" y="4754880"/><a:ext cx="457200" cy="274320"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{C572A759-6A51-4108-AA02-DFA0A04FC94B}"><ma14:wrappingTextBoxFlag xmlns:ma14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/mac/drawingml/2011/main" val="0"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle><a:lvl1pPr><a:defRPr sz="1000"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="7A8699"/></a:solidFill></a:defRPr></a:lvl1pPr></a:lstStyle><a:p><a:pPr algn="r"/><a:fld id="{F7021451-1387-4CA6-816F-3879F97B5CBC}" type="s